 public debt securities issued by the Treasury and debt issued by other Federal agencies under special financing authorities. See the Federal debt (FD) series of tables for a more complete description of the Federal debt.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 409, 745, 459], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"Table OFS-1.--Distribution of Federal Securities by Class of Investors and Type of Issues\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [91, 481, 745, 652], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"Holdings of Treasury marketable and nonmarketable securities and of debt issued by other Federal agencies are presented for Government accounts, the Federal Reserve banks, and private investors. Government account holdings largely reflect investment by the social security and Federal retirement trust funds. The Federal Reserve banks acquire Treasury securities in the market as a means of executing monetary policy.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [512, 117, 1023, 141], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"OWNERSHIP OF FEDERAL SECURITIES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [670, 188, 864, 208], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [791, 267, 1440, 314], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"Table OFS-2.--Estimated Ownership of Public Debt Securities Held by Private Investors\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [791, 340, 1441, 599], \"page_id\": 75}], \"content\": \"Privately held Treasury securities are those held by investors other than the Government accounts and Federal Reserve banks. Treasury obtains information on private holdings from a variety of sources, such as data gathered by the Federal financial institution regulatory agencies. State and local holdings and foreign holdings include special issues of nonmarketable securities to municipal entities and foreign official accounts, as well as municipal and foreign official and private holdings of marketable Treasury securities. Data on foreign holdings of marketable Treasury securities are presented in the capital movements tables in the Treasury Bulletin. See the footnotes for descriptions of the investor categories.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [58, 53, 88, 75], \"page_id\": 76}], \"content\": \"62\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [156, 102, 1289, 179], \"page_id\": 76}], \"content\": \"OWNERSHIP OF FEDERAL SECURITIES Table OFS-1.--Distribution of Federal Securities by Class of Investors and Type of Issues\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [496, 190, 935, 213], \"page_id\": 76}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars. Source: Financial Management Service)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [40, 215, 1401, 726], \"page_id\": 76}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>End of fiscal year or month</th><th>Total Federal securities outstanding</th><th>Total outstanding</th><th colspan=\\\"3\\\">Held by U.S. Government accounts</th><th>Public issues held by Federal Reserve banks</th></tr><tr><th></th><th></th><th></th><th>Total</th><th>Marketable</th><th>Nonmarketable</th><th></th></tr><tr><td>1986</td><td>2,129,522</td><td>2,122,684</td><td>382,859</td><td>20,844</td><td>362,015</td><td>190,751</td></tr><tr><td>1987</td><td>2,354,286</td><td>2,347,750</td><td>457,167</td><td>17,481</td><td>439,686</td><td>211,941</td></tr><tr><td>1988</td><td>2,614,581</td><td>2,599,877</td><td>550,448</td><td>14,835</td><td>535,613</td><td>229,181</td></tr><tr><td>1989</td><td>2,881,112</td><td>2,836,309</td><td>676,705</td><td>12,896</td><td>663,809</td><td>220,551</td>